# What to check while the Skyrme iteration runs. Nothing here prints; the watches and holds go into the story
# (`viv story lib/skyrme/story_o16.viv`), and a failed hold fails the run.
#
# Per iteration: the energy E (MeV), its change de, and the spin-orbit
# splittings of the neutron and proton 1p levels, e(1p1/2) - e(1p3/2). At
# the mix: the numbers of neutrons and protons in the new densities, which
# the holds require to be 8 each.
skyrme_hf  @5541c956
  watch per iteration  E, de, split_n, split_p
  watch at mix         n_neutrons, n_protons
  hold at mix          n_neutrons == N_N within 1e-9           "the new densities hold 8 neutrons"
  hold at mix          n_protons == Z_P within 1e-9            "the new densities hold 8 protons"
  hold at energy       split_n > 0.0 and split_p > 0.0         "the spin-orbit field puts 1p3/2 below 1p1/2, for neutrons and for protons"
  watch at start       pn
  watch at diagonalize sigma
  watch at observables r2p, r2n
